    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "INSURANCE AND DAMAGE WAIVER",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SH"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Renter must have adequate insurance coverage or purchase the damage waiver offered by Owner. Options:",
      "style": "BT"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        "Option",
        "Coverage",
        "Cost",
        "Deductible"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Option 1 \u2014 Renter's Own Insurance",
          "Renter uses their own personal RV/trailer insurance. Renter is responsible for their deductible and any amounts not covered by their policy.",
          "$0",
          "{{renter_own_deductible}}"
        ],
        [
          "Option 2 \u2014 Owner's Insurance (Primary)",
          "Owner's insurance is primary. Renter pays a damage waiver fee and is responsible for a per-claim deductible.",
          "{{owner_policy_cost}}",
          "{{owner_policy_deductible}}"
        ],
        [
          "Option 3 \u2014 Damage Waiver (CDW/LDW)",
          "Collision Damage Waiver / Loss Damage Waiver. Covers damage to the Vehicle from collision or theft, subject to exclusions. Does not cover personal belongings or third-party liability.",
          "{{cdw_cost}}",
          "{{cdw_deductible}}"
        ],
        [
          "Option 4 \u2014 No Coverage",
          "Renter is fully responsible for all damage, loss, theft, and liability.",
          "$0",
          "Full amount"
        ]
      ],
      "style": "Table Grid"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "CAMPSITE AND UTILITIES",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SH"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "If the RV is equipped with utility hookups (electricity, water, sewer, propane), Renter acknowledges:",
      "style": "BT"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "Renter is responsible for proper setup and takedown of all utility connections.",
        "Renter must use only approved campgrounds, RV parks, or legal overnight parking locations.",
        "Renter must not hook up to utilities that are not rated for the Vehicle's requirements.",
        "Renter is responsible for any damage caused by improper utility hookup.",
        "Renter must dispose of waste water and sewage only at approved dump stations.",
        "{{campsite_utilities_extra}}"
      ]
    },
